<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0a0907" />
  <meta name="description" content="BUILT ENOUGH: BODY RETURN — a SHIMS-based personal movement practice, moment engine and self-lab." />
  <link rel="manifest" href="manifest.webmanifest" />
  <link rel="icon" href="assets/icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css" />
  <title>BUILT ENOUGH: BODY RETURN</title>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app-shell">
    <header class="topbar">
      <div>
        <p class="brand-line">BUILT ENOUGH</p>
        <h1>BODY RETURN</h1>
      </div>
      <button class="icon-button" id="menuButton" aria-label="Open route overview" title="Route overview">↗</button>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="heroTitle">
        <p class="route-statement" id="heroTitle">I’ve built enough. Now something needs to come back into my life.</p>
        <p class="principle">Numbers guide the shape. <strong>Your body sets the boundary.</strong> The moment creates the opening. Use supplies the proof.</p>
      </section>

      <nav class="tabs" aria-label="Main sections">
        <button class="tab active" data-tab="today">Today</button>
        <button class="tab" data-tab="moments">Moments</button>
        <button class="tab" data-tab="setup">Set-up</button>
        <button class="tab" data-tab="record">Record</button>
        <button class="tab" data-tab="route">Route</button>
      </nav>

      <section id="today" class="tab-panel active">
        <div id="profileMissing" class="empty-state">
          <h2>Build your first Body Return</h2>
          <p>Your date of birth creates the symbolic pattern. Your current capacity decides what is realistic today.</p>
          <button class="primary-button" data-open-tab="setup">Create my pattern</button>
        </div>

        <div id="todayContent" class="hidden">
          <div class="signature-strip">
            <div>
              <span class="small-label">PERSONAL SIGNATURE</span>
              <strong id="signatureCode">—</strong>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="small-label">LEVEL</span>
              <strong id="levelValue">1</strong>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="small-label">STREAK</span>
              <strong><span id="streakValue">0</span>d</strong>
            </div>
          </div>

          <article class="panel instant-panel">
            <div class="panel-heading">
              <div>
                <span class="small-label">RIGHT NOW</span>
                <h2>Turn this moment into movement</h2>
              </div>
              <span class="return-count"><strong id="todayReturnCount">0</strong> today</span>
            </div>
            <p class="muted">Starting, finishing, waiting, celebrating or resetting can become a small physical return.</p>
            <div class="quick-trigger-grid" id="todayQuickTriggers"></div>
            <button class="secondary-button wide" data-open-tab="moments">Open the full moment engine</button>
          </article>

          <article class="panel focus-panel">
            <div class="panel-heading">
              <div>
                <span class="small-label">TODAY’S ROUTE</span>
                <h2 id="routineTitle">Foundation Session</h2>
              </div>
              <button class="secondary-button compact" id="regenerateButton">Regenerate</button>
            </div>
            <p id="routineReason" class="muted"></p>
            <div id="exerciseList" class="exercise-list"></div>
            <div class="routine-footer">
              <div>
                <span class="small-label">REST</span>
                <strong id="restValue">—</strong>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span class="small-label">ROUNDS</span>
                <strong id="roundValue">—</strong>
              </div>
              <button class="primary-button" id="completeSessionButton" disabled>Complete session</button>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="panel">
            <div class="panel-heading">
              <div>
                <span class="small-label">BODY CONTEXT</span>
                <h2>Markers, not verdicts</h2>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="contextMarkers" class="context-grid"></div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="moments" class="tab-panel">
        <div id="momentsMissing" class="empty-state">
          <h2>Create your pattern first</h2>
          <p>The moment engine needs a baseline before it can make a small, personal movement suggestion.</p>
          <button class="primary-button" data-open-tab="setup">Go to set-up</button>
        </div>

        <div id="momentsContent" class="hidden">
          <article class="panel moment-builder">
            <span class="small-label">STATE → MOVEMENT</span>
            <h2>What is happening right now?</h2>
            <p class="muted">Choose the moment. BODY RETURN will generate a small dose rather than a full workout.</p>
            <div class="trigger-grid" id="triggerGrid"></div>

            <h3>What is around you?</h3>
            <div class="environment-grid" id="environmentGrid"></div>
          </article>

          <article id="microReturnCard" class="panel micro-card hidden" aria-live="polite">
            <div class="micro-top">
              <div>
                <span class="small-label" id="microTriggerLabel">MOMENT RETURN</span>
                <h2 id="microTitle">—</h2>
              </div>
              <div class="micro-number" id="microNumber">—</div>
            </div>
            <p class="micro-dose" id="microDose">—</p>
            <p class="muted" id="microReason">—</p>
            <div class="micro-actions">
              <button class="secondary-button" id="swapMicroButton">Give me another</button>
              <button class="primary-button" id="completeMicroButton">Done — record return</button>
            </div>
            <button class="text-button" id="intentionButton">Not moving right now — give me an intention version</button>
          </article>

          <article class="panel reminder-panel">
            <div class="panel-heading">
              <div>
